{"version":1,"content":"<p>供應鏈消息顯示蘋果計劃在2027年上半年將iPad Air產品線全面升級至OLED顯示屏，這意味着現有兩種尺寸的iPad Air都將告別LCD面板。事實上，關於OLED版iPad Air的傳聞已持續一年多時間。早在2025年10月，就有消息稱蘋果正在開發採用OLED屏幕的iPad Air，而發佈時間預計不會早於2027年。近期相關爆料進一步將時間範圍縮小至2027年上半年，而最新報告則補充了出貨量預測以及供應鏈分配情況。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585824.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.763324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:48:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_hash":"bcbc809aa76159515f44207e6df3c68aa171391f98dd95c9846d61ec8e5f496d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}